      "sha256": "052c4a9ae2870c991e735cc64e71fcf744c673a73d4d317fed482e066af62e4c",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Fig. 5. An example of participants manually annotating a graph for discussion: P14 circled the outlier point in a scatter plot using MS Paint and sent it back to P15 using Slack."
